{
  "title": "Dua e Faraj - Ilahi Azomal Bala اِلٰهِيْ عَظُمَ الْبَلَاۤءُ",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "اِلٰهِیْ عَظُمَ الْبَلَآءُ \nEELAAHI A’ZOMAL BALAAA-O \nO Allah, terrible was the calamity, \nوَ بَرِحَ الْخَفَآءُ\nWA BAREHAL KHAFAAA-O \nand its evil consequences are visible,\nوَ انْكَشَفَ الْغِطَآءُ \nWAN KASHAFAL GHETAAA-O \nthe covering has been removed,\nوَ انْقَطَعَ الرَّجَاءُ\nWAN QATA-A'R RAJAAA-O \n(all) hopes have been cut off, \nوَ ضَاقَتِ الْاَرْضُ\nWA ZAAQATIL ARZO \nthe (plentiful) earth has shrunk (with very little to spare), \nوَ مُنِعَتِ السَّمَآءُ \nWA MONE-A'TIS SAMAAA-O \nthe heavenly blessings have been withheld. \nوَ اَنْتَ الْمُسْتَعَانُ\nWA ANTAL MUSTA-A’ANO \nYou alone can help, \nوَ اِلَیْكَ الْمُشْتَكٰی \nWA ELAYKAL MUSHTAKAA, \nwe refer our grief and sorrow to You, \nوَ عَلَیْكَ الْمُعَوَّلُ فِی الشِّدَّۃِ وَ الرَّخَآءِ \nWA A’LAYKAL MO-A'WWALO FISH-SHIDDATE WAR RAKHAAA-E.\nwe have full faith in You, in the time of distress, as well as in good fortune. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰی مُحَمَّدٍ وَّاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ \nALLAAHUMMA SALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADIWN WA AALE MOHAMMADIN \nO Allah, send blessings on Muhammad and on the children of Muhammad, \nاُوْلِی الْاَمْرِ الَّذِیْنَ فَرَضْتَ عَلَیْنَا طَاعَتَهُمْ \nOLIL AMRIL LAZEENA FARAZTA A’LAYNAA TAA-A’TAHUM \nThe ‘Ulil Amr’ (authority), obedience to whom has been made obligatory\nوَ عَرَّفْتَنَا بِذٰلِكَ مَنْزِلَتَهُمْ \nWA A’RRAFTANAA BE ZAALEKA MANZELATAHUM \nthrough which we become aware of their rank and status, \nفَفَرِّجْ عَنَّا بِحَقِّهِمْ فَرَجًا عَاجِلًا قَرِیْبًا \nFA-FARRIJ A'NNAA BE HAQQEHIM FARAJAN A-A’JELAN QAREEBAN \nTherefore let there be joy after sorrow for us, for their sake, right away, \nكَلَمْحِ الْبَصَرِ اَوْ هُوَ اَقْرَبُ \nKALAM-HIL BASARE AW HOWA AQRABO \nin the twinkle of an eye, more rapidly than that. \nیَا مُحَمَّدُ یَا عَلِیُّ یَا عَلِیُّ یَا مُحَمَّدُ \nYAA MOHAMMADO YAA A'LIYYO YAA A'LIYYO YAA MOHAMMADO \nا O Muhammad, O Ali, O Ali, O Muhammad, \nِكْفِیَا نِیْ فَاِنَّكُمَا كَافِیَانِ \nIKFEYAANI FA INNAKOMAA KAAFEYAANE \nGive me enough, because both of you provide sufficiently. \nوَانْصُرَانِ فَاِنَّكُمَا نَاصِرَانِ \nWAN SORAANEE FA-INNAKOMAA NAASERAANE \nHelp me, because both of you help and protect.\nیَا مَوْلَانَا یَاصَاحِبَ الزَّمَانِ \nYAA MAWLAANAA YAA SAAHEBAZ ZAMAANE. \nO our master, O the living Imam, \nالْغَوْثَ الْغَوْثَ الْغَوْتَ\nAL-GHAWS AL-GHAWS AL-GHAWS \nHELP! HELP! HELP! \nاَدْرِكْنِیْ اَدْرِكْنِیَ اَدْرِكْنِیَ \nADRIKNEE ADRIKNEE ADRIKNEE. \nReach me! Reach me! Reach me!\nالسَّاعَۃَ السَّاعَۃَ السَّاعَۃَ\nAS-SAA-A'TA AS-SAA-A'TA AS-SAA-A'TA\nAt once, in this hour. \nاَلْعَجَلَ الْعَجَلَ الْعَجَلَ \nAL-A'JAL AL-A'JAL AL-A'JAL \nBe quick, be quick, be quick, \nیَا اَرْحَمَ الرَّاحِمِیْنَ\nYAA ARHAMAR RAAHEMEEN. \nO the most merciful, \nبِحَقِّ مُحَمَّدٍ وَّاٰلِهِ الطَّاهِرِیْنَ.\nBE-HAQQE MOHAMMADIWN WA AALEHIT TAAHEREEN.\nfor the sake of Muhammad and his pure children."
}
